---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Resume — Matt Twells"
  description="Resume of Matt Twells"
  constrained={true}
>
  <div class="reading-copy">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">&lt;Résumé /&gt;</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-gray-400">
    You can view the résumé below or
    <a href="/Matt-Twells-Resume-v4.5-Spacing-Fixed.pdf" download="Matt-Twells-Resume-v4.5.pdf" class="underline">
  download the PDF version
  </a>
  </p>

  <br />

  <!-- Fake terminal compile + run -->
  <div class="terminal-box">
    <div class="terminal-header">
      <span class="dot red"></span>
      <span class="dot yellow"></span>
      <span class="dot green"></span>
      <span class="title">matthew@twells:~</span>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <p class="command">
        <span class="prompt">$</span> gcc <span class="flag">-Wall -Wextra</span
        > resume.c -o resume
      </p>
      <p class="command"><span class="prompt">$</span> ./resume</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- Work Experience -->
  <!-- =============================== -->
  <div class="section-header">
    <p>
      <span class="prompt">$</span>
      <span class="command">cd</span> experience
    </p>
  </div>

    <!-- DeepSeas -->
  <div>
    <p>
      <span class="prompt">$</span>
      <span class="command">cat</span>
      <span class="file">deepseas_experience.txt</span>
    </p>
    <p class="job-title">
      Principal Solutions Engineer <span class="company">— DeepSeas, LLC</span>
    </p>
    <p class="dates">Apr 2026 – Present</p>
    <p>
      Primary SE for 36 closed-won deals in my first seven months, exceeding
      $1M in attributable ACV; Q3 closed-won ACV was approximately 2.6x Q2.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      I lead technical discovery, architecture discussions, and presentations
      with CISOs, VPs, and senior security leaders in an estimated 85%+ of
      customer-facing engagements.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li class="bullet">
        Own nationwide enterprise solutioning from discovery through close;
        led a complex semiconductor-sector RFP win and scoped a multi-tenant
        Microsoft 365 security assessment spanning 11 tenants.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Helped secure the company's first two DeepSeas Complete engagements; a
        post-ransomware response customer converted to a one-year managed
        relationship and later purchased additional services in a successful
        upsell.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Delivered six partner enablement sessions in two months, including one
        in person; developed the DeepSeas Core Messaging and Positioning Guide
        for sales reps and the DeepSeas Master Capability Guide for partner
        reps.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Built and maintained a 35-asset pre-sales enablement library combining
        original guides and frameworks with AI-assisted collateral for
        discovery, competitive positioning, and partner support.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Reduced average proposal turnaround to under one hour across all
        opportunities I personally scoped, while standardizing repeat-service
        statements of work.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Designed and implemented a repeatable pre-sales-to-post-sales handoff
        using a dedicated cross-functional channel and structured deal-context
        template, adopted across Sales, SE, Delivery, and Customer Success to
        preserve deal nuance and improve continuity.
      </li>
      <li class="bullet">
        Partner with Product, Sales Ops, and leadership on service packaging,
        positioning, technical onboarding, and channel development.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <!-- Bishop Fox -->
